.SH "نام (NAME)"
cvslastchange \- Display the last change committed to CVS for a file
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.HP \w'\fBcvslastchange\fR\ 'u
\fBcvslastchange\fR [\fIfile\fR]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
\fBcvslastchange\fR
displays the last change committed to
CVS
for a file\&. It uses
\fBcvs diff\fR
and
\fBcvs log\fR
to do this\&.
.PP
\fBcvslastchange\fR
works on any
CVS
branch, not just HEAD\&.
.PP
This utility is part of the
KDE
Software Development Kit\&.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.PP
cvslastlog(1) cvsrevertlast(1) cvs(1)
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
.PP
